{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0128","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:00000039:text","row":23141,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩……」","en":"“Misato...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00001","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Senpai...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:000000e3:text","row":23142,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「なぁに？」","en":"“Yeees?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00002","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00002","en":"Misato: \"Wha-at?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:0000010f:text","row":23143,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺のためにこれからずっと、みそ汁を作ってくれませんか？」","en":"“Will you make miso soup for me for the rest of our lives?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00003","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Could you, from now on, make Miso soup for me... always?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:00000161:text","row":23144,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"なぜか俺はプロポーズしてしまった。","en":"For some reason, I had just proposed to her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00004","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00004","en":"For some reason I popped the question.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:00000221:text","row":23145,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“Huh?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00005","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00005","en":"Misato: \"Eh?!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:00000241:text","row":23146,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩はうろたえる。","en":"Misato lost her composure.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00006","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00006","en":"Senpai grows flustered.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:0000026b:text","row":23147,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"体が傾いで、視線がそれる。","en":"She listed to one side, her gaze sliding away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00007","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00007","en":"She leans forwards to avert her gaze.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:0000029d:text","row":23148,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"小さな拳が口元に添えられ、額に思案の皺が刻まれた。","en":"A small fist rose to her lips, a crease of concentration furrowing her brow.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00008","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00008","en":"A tiny clenched fist accompanies itself to the mouth, and the wrinkles of thought chiseled her forehead.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:0000036d:text","row":23149,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくん……わたし……」","en":"“Peke... I...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00009","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00009","en":"Misato: \"Peke-kun... I...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:000003a7:text","row":23150,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00010","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Yes?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:000003ec:text","row":23151,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「みそ汁、作れないんです」","en":"“I don’t know how to make miso soup.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00011","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00011","en":"Misato: \"I cannot make Miso soup... I just cannot.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:00000426:text","row":23152,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「らりほー！」","en":"“Rally-ho!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00012","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00012","en":">                       snooze\nTaichi: \"Rarihooo!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:0000044c:text","row":23153,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"窓から叫んだ。","en":"I shouted it out the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00013","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00013","en":"A shout out from the window.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:00000472:text","row":23154,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"古式ゆかしいナイスボケだった。","en":"A fine, time-honored piece of comic nonsense.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00014","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025a:00014","en":"A traditional fool's play that was.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:000004d0:choice:01","row":23155,"ordinal":15,"kind":"choice","jp":"さらに迫る","en":"Push further","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0128:000004d0:choice:02","row":23156,"ordinal":16,"kind":"choice","jp":"ボケる","en":"Crack a joke","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
